# AI Allowed Guardrails

- Pick issues only when labeled `AI_ALLOWED` and `Ready for Dev`.
- Branch names: `ai/{ISSUE_KEY}-{slug}`.
- Directories `infra/**` and `secrets/**` are read-only.
- Add or update automated tests when touching executable code.
- Run `pytest` and ensure green before PR prep.
- Draft PR body with summary + Jira link.
